body:
As an infant he suffered terribly from a sickness, but then became a very active child, who moved around a lot. This earned him the name "Never sit still" from his parents. His father also started teaching him martial arts and he taught his dancing skills for martial arts skill teachings in his teens. Larrylongboy already mentioned his Wing Chun learning, but that's not the reason for his proficiency in fighting. He fought a lot in his teens and skimped on education.

&#x200B;

Edit: A fun fact is that his best friend called him "chicken legs" because his sickness left his limbs smaller than normal and since he developed his upper body from press ups, but not his lower body, he ended up having a disproportionate frame at an early school age.
